c/chunks/61cc43b3d7ad2990.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5552623386487b15.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1d7d79b8f76d8a62.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/6bcaf73165d03f74.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/474ace38d7992a17.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/c9e031433494c7b2.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://www.google-analytics.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://analytics.ahrefs.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://www.google-analytics.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://analytics.ahrefs.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://www.irs.gov\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://taxfoundation.org\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0a0f1e\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Paycheck Difference Calculator 2026 — Compare Take-Home | TheTaxCalc</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Calculate the difference in take-home pay between two states or salaries. See how much more or less you earn after taxes by moving or changing jobs. Free 2026 calculator.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"paycheck difference calculator,take home pay difference,paycheck comparison by state,compare paychecks after tax,how much difference does state tax make,paycheck calculator state comparison,net pay difference calculator,take home pay by state\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"TheTaxCalc\"/><meta name=\"publisher\" content=\"TheTaxCalc\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><meta name=\"category\" content=\"finance\"/><meta name=\"classification\" content=\"Tax Calculator\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/paycheck-difference-calculator\"/><meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"verify_google_site_verification_token\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Paycheck Difference Calculator 2026 — Compare Take-Home\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Calculate the difference in take-home pay between two states or salaries. Free 2026 calculator for all 50 states.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/paycheck-difference-calculator\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TheTaxCalc\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Paycheck Difference Calculator — TheTaxCalc\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Paycheck Difference Calculator 2026 — Compare Take-Home\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Calculate the difference in take-home pay between two states. Free for all 50 states.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><script data-cfasync=\"false\">(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\nj=d.createEleme